# S Language Reference 4.0

## Keywords
let var fn ret if elif else while for in loop break next
class new this safe rescue print assert when enum
defer async await spawn repeat as guard use

## Types (annotations)
int str bool dec list map opt — checked lightly by s check

## Operators
+ - * / % == != < > <= >= and or not
|> ?? ?. ? : (ternary) += -= *= /=

## Builtins (selected)
print len map filter push pop sort unique sum any all
some none valueOr ok err unwrap require freeze
json_parse json_stringify http_get http_post
hash clock min max abs floor ceil round clamp
keys values take drop find zip
html_escape html_tag html_page
env_get path_join regex_match csv_split date_fmt exit

## CLI
s run | check | test | new | build | release | serve | html build
s doctor | repl | vm | hub | log | version
